// 用东财真实分红 + 东财真实不复权K线，复现面板 _mComputeOne 的目标买价算法
const https = require('https');
function get(u) {
  return new Promise((res, rej) => {
    const r = https.get(u, { headers: { 'User-Agent': 'Mozilla/5.0', 'Referer': 'https://data.eastmoney.com/' } }, x => {
      if (x.statusCode >= 300 && x.statusCode < 400 && x.headers.location) { x.resume(); return get(x.headers.location).then(res, rej); }
      const c = []; x.on('data', d => c.push(d)); x.on('end', () => res(Buffer.concat(c).toString('utf8')));
    });
    r.on('error', rej); r.setTimeout(30000, () => r.destroy(new Error('timeout')));
  });
}
const CODE = '000999';
const SECID = '0.000999';

(async () => {
  // 1) 分红
  const du = 'https://datacenter-web.eastmoney.com/api/data/v1/get?reportName=RPT_SHAREBONUS_DET&columns=ALL&filter=(SECURITY_CODE%3D%22' + CODE + '%22)&pageNumber=1&pageSize=100&sortColumns=EX_DIVIDEND_DATE&sortTypes=-1';
  const dj = JSON.parse(await get(du));
  const divs = ((dj.result && dj.result.data) || [])
    .filter(r => r.EX_DIVIDEND_DATE && +r.PRETAX_BONUS_RMB > 0)
    .map(r => ({ d: String(r.EX_DIVIDEND_DATE).slice(0, 10), v: +r.PRETAX_BONUS_RMB / 10 }))
    .sort((a, b) => a.d < b.d ? -1 : 1);

  // 2) 不复权K线（3年+40天）
  const today = new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10);
  const begD = new Date(Date.now() - (3 * 365 + 40) * 864e5).toISOString().slice(0, 10).replace(/-/g, '');
  const ku = 'https://push2his.eastmoney.com/api/qt/stock/kline/get?secid=' + SECID +
    '&fields1=f1,f2,f3,f4,f5&fields2=f51,f52,f53,f54,f55,f56&klt=101&fqt=0&beg=' + begD + '&end=20500101';
  const kj = JSON.parse(await get(ku));
  const raw = ((kj.data && kj.data.klines) || []).map(l => { const p = l.split(','); return { d: p[0], c: +p[2] }; });

  console.log('=== 数据规模 ===');
  console.log('分红记录', divs.length, '条；不复权K线', raw.length, '根');
  console.log('K线区间:', raw[0].d, '~', raw[raw.length - 1].d);
  const price = raw[raw.length - 1].c;
  console.log('最新不复权收盘 =', price);

  // 3) 每个交易日算「过去12个月已派现 / 当日价」的分位与均值
  function dpsAsOf(dateStr) {
    const d0 = new Date(dateStr + 'T00:00:00');
    const d1 = new Date(d0.getTime() - 365 * 864e5);
    return divs.filter(x => x.d > d1.toISOString().slice(0, 10) && x.d <= dateStr)
      .reduce((a, x) => a + x.v, 0);
  }
  const hist = [];
  raw.forEach(r => {
    const dps = dpsAsOf(r.d);
    if (dps > 0 && r.c > 0) hist.push({ d: r.d, y: dps / r.c * 100 });
  });
  const ys = hist.map(x => x.y);
  const avg = ys.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0) / ys.length;
  const curYld = ys[ys.length - 1];
  const below = ys.filter(v => v <= curYld).length;
  const pct = below / ys.length * 100;

  console.log('');
  console.log('=== 面板算法结果（fqt=0，3年窗口） ===');
  console.log('样本数 N       =', ys.length, ys.length >= 250 ? '(足够)' : '(不足250)');
  console.log('当前股息率     =', curYld.toFixed(2) + '%');
  console.log('近3年均值      =', avg.toFixed(3) + '%');
  console.log('当前分位       =', pct.toFixed(1) + '%');

  // 4) dynamic: max(floor, avg + pad)
  const pad = 1, floor = 5;
  const rawT = avg + pad;
  const targetYld = Math.max(floor, rawT);
  console.log('');
  console.log('=== 目标股息率（dynamic） ===');
  console.log('均值+垫 =', avg.toFixed(2), '+', pad, '=', rawT.toFixed(3) + '%');
  console.log('下限     =', floor + '%');
  console.log('>>> 目标股息率 =', targetYld.toFixed(3) + '%', '(取较大者)');

  const dpsNow = dpsAsOf(today);
  const tb = dpsNow / (targetYld / 100);
  console.log('');
  console.log('=== 目标买价 ===');
  console.log('近12月dps =', dpsNow.toFixed(4));
  console.log('>>> 目标买价 =', tb.toFixed(2), '元');
  console.log('>>> 距现价需跌 =', ((price - tb) / price * 100).toFixed(1) + '%');
  console.log('');
  console.log('【对照】若用 5% 固定下限：', (dpsNow / 0.05).toFixed(2), '元，需跌', ((price - dpsNow / 0.05) / price * 100).toFixed(1) + '%');
})().catch(e => { console.error('ERR', e.message); process.exit(1); });

